  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PIP_Supporting Women in Law (SuWIL)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at addressing the under-representation of women in the justice sector as legal professionals. This will be done through supporting young women in three stages of their education and careers: in law schools, as fresh law graduates and as young practitioners.</narrative>
  </description>
